{"4537830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SOCIETY", "steam_appid": 4537830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A multi-friend-group social survival crafting game. </strong>  <br><strong>It's your friends against their friends. </strong><br><strong>Survive, gather, craft, build. </strong> <br><strong>Then steal, kidnap, ally, betray, negotiate, and convert.</strong><br><strong>SOCIETY.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a social survival crafting multi-friend-group game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends survive on an island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather, explore, craft, farm, and build.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Other friend groups are on this island too, but <strong>only one can rule the island</strong></u>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steal, kidnap, ally, betray, and negotiate your way to become this island's ruler.</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no NPCs. Every player is real. Proximity voice chat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game takes social conversational skill to win. </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A multi-friend-group social survival crafting game. </strong>  <br><strong>It's your friends against their friends. </strong><br><strong>Survive, gather, craft, build. </strong> <br><strong>Then steal, kidnap, ally, betray, negotiate, and convert.</strong><br><strong>SOCIETY.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a social survival crafting multi-friend-group game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends survive on an island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather, explore, craft, farm, and build.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Other friend groups are on this island too, but <strong>only one can